### 3. Patch Generation

We need to update the event listeners for `'create.end'` and `'autoPlace.end'` to check if the event is part of a paste operation and, if so, skip activating direct editing.

Assuming the paste operation sets a flag like `event.context.isPaste` (this is a common pattern in BPMN-js and similar libraries).

